+"Start eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines. `--dp-address` uses the Decode node\n"
+"    IP. The launcher assigns API ports `9900-9907`."
+msgstr ""
+"启动 8 个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Decode 节点的 IP 地址，启动器分配 API 端口 "
+"`9900-9907`。"
+
+msgid "**Deploy the PD Proxy**"
+msgstr "**部署 PD 代理**"
+
+msgid ""
+"After all Prefill and Decode engines are ready, open another terminal in\n"
+"    the Prefill container and start the\n"
+"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
+"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, distributes requests across Prefill\n"
+"    endpoints `9081-9082`, and then forwards Decode work to endpoints\n"
+"    `9900-9907`."
+msgstr ""
+"所有 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎就绪后，在 Prefill "
+"容器中打开另一个终端，启动[负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。代理监听端口"
+" `8081`，将请求分发至 Prefill 端点 `9081-9082`，再将 Decode 工作转发至端点 `9900-9907`。"
+
+msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions**"
+msgstr "**关键参数说明**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP2/TP8 on\n"
+"      Prefill and DP8/TP2 on Decode. Both layouts use all 16 logical devices\n"
+"      on their respective Atlas 800I A3 nodes.\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP\n"
+"      ranks within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs.\n"
+"      The default RPC port `12325` can be reused because the roles run on\n"
+"      different hosts.\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` assigns API ports `9081-9082` on Prefill, while\n"
+"      `--vllm-start-port 9900` assigns `9900-9907` on Decode. All endpoints\n"
+"      must be reachable from the proxy.\n"
+"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`, `--kv-cache-dtype int8`, and\n"
+"      MTP speculative decoding with five speculative tokens. The MTP draft\n"
+"      model uses `enforce_eager: true` on Prefill and `enforce_eager: false`\n"
+"      on Decode.\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
+"      roles for this configuration.\n"
+"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 64` and\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`. Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits\n"
+"      independently for the target workload.\n"
+"    - Prefill sets `--prefix-cache-retention-interval None`. For KV Cache\n"
+"      Pool deployment, apply the prefix-caching changes in Section 5.4.\n"
+"    - Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode. Both roles explicitly\n"
+"      enable FlashComm1.\n"
+"    - Prefill sets `enable_dsa_cp: true`, `enable_prefill_mc2: true`,\n"
+"      `enable_fused_mc2: 1`, and `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`, with\n"
+"      `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false`. Decode sets\n"
+"      `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` and\n"
+"      `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`.\n"
+"    - Both Prefill and Decode use `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`, allowing\n"
+"      at most one image per prompt and disabling video input.\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
+"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode.\n"
+"      The role-specific KV ports must be available on their respective hosts.\n"
+"    - `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` selects `hccs:device`, and\n"
+"      `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` sets resource configuration version `1.2` for\n"
+"      this HCCS supernode. `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must\n"
+"      select the host network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC,\n"
+"      engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must be allowed by the host firewall."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--data-parallel-size` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size` 分别指定 Prefill 的 DP2/TP8 和 Decode 的 DP8/TP2 布局。两种布局均使用各自 Atlas 800I A3 节点的全部 16 个逻辑设备。\n"
+"    - `--data-parallel-address` 和 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 协调同一角色内的 DP rank。Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自节点的 IP 地址。由于两个角色运行在不同主机上，可以复用默认 RPC 端口 `12325`。\n"
+"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` 为 Prefill 分配 API 端口 `9081-9082`，`--vllm-start-port 9900` 为 Decode 分配端口 `9900-9907`。代理必须能够访问所有端点。\n"
+"    - 两个角色均使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`、`--kv-cache-dtype int8`，以及包含 5 个推测 Token 的 MTP 推测解码。MTP 草稿模型在 Prefill 上使用 `enforce_eager: true`，在 Decode 上使用 `enforce_eager: false`。\n"
+"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 为此配置的两个角色显式选择 model runner V1。\n"
+"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 64` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`，Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`。请根据目标工作负载分别调整两个角色的调度限制。\n"
+"    - Prefill 设置 `--prefix-cache-retention-interval None`。部署 KV Cache 池时，请按照第 5.4 节调整前缀缓存配置。\n"
+"    - Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。两个角色均显式启用 FlashComm1。\n"
+"    - Prefill 设置 `enable_dsa_cp: true`、`enable_prefill_mc2: true`、`enable_fused_mc2: 1` 和 `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`，同时设置 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false`。Decode 设置 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` 和 `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`。\n"
+"    - Prefill 和 Decode 均使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`，每个提示词最多允许 1 张图像，并禁用视频输入。\n"
+"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在两个角色之间传输 KV cache。Prefill 的 `kv_role` 必须为 `kv_producer`，Decode 必须为 `kv_consumer`。各角色的 KV 端口必须在各自主机上可用。\n"
+"    - `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 选择 `hccs:device`，`ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` 为该 HCCS 超节点设置资源配置版本 `1.2`。`HCCL_IF_IP` 和所有 socket 接口变量必须选择所配置节点 IP 所在的主机网络。主机防火墙必须允许 DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This example uses four Atlas 800I A2 (64GB × 8) servers: two Prefill\n"
+"    nodes running one DP rank with TP8 each (DP2/TP8 in total), and two\n"
+"    Decode nodes running four DP ranks with TP2 each (DP8/TP2 in total).\n"
+"    Each Prefill rank uses eight devices, and each Decode rank uses two.\n"
+"    Together, the local ranks use all eight devices on each server.\n"
+"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from the Prefill engines to the\n"
+"    Decode engines. The topology names the two Prefill nodes P0/P1 and the\n"
+"    two Decode nodes D0/D1. P0 serves the Prefill API endpoint; P1 is\n"
+"    headless. The proxy addresses the API endpoints on both Decode nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"本示例使用四台 Atlas 800I A2（64GB × 8）服务器：两个 Prefill 节点各运行 1 个使用 TP8 的 DP rank（全局为 "
+"DP2/TP8），两个 Decode 节点各运行 4 个使用 TP2 的 DP rank（全局为 DP8/TP2）。每个 Prefill rank 使用"
+" 8 个设备，每个 Decode rank 使用 2 个设备，各服务器上的本地 rank 合计使用全部 8 "
+"个设备。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV cache 从 Prefill 引擎传输至 Decode 引擎。拓扑中两个 Prefill"
+" 节点分别命名为 P0/P1，两个 Decode 节点分别命名为 D0/D1。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点，P1 以 headless "
+"模式运行。代理访问两个 Decode 节点上的 API 端点。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The shared `launch_online_dp.py` launcher from Section 5.3.1 starts the\n"
+"    engines on all four nodes. Save the common serving templates below and the\n"
+"    node-specific wrapper scripts on their respective nodes. Replace all IP,\n"
+"    NIC, and model-path placeholders."
+msgstr ""
+"第 5.2.1 节中的共享启动器 `launch_online_dp.py` "
+"用于在全部四个节点上启动引擎。请将以下通用服务模板和各节点的包装脚本分别保存到对应节点，并替换所有 IP、网卡名称和模型路径占位符。"
+
+msgid "**Common Prefill template**"
+msgstr "**通用 Prefill 模板**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following script as `run_p.sh` on P0 and P1. The node wrappers\n"
+"    below provide `LOCAL_IP` and the API/headless role."
+msgstr ""
+"将以下脚本保存为 P0 和 P1 上的 `run_p.sh`。下方的节点包装脚本提供 `LOCAL_IP` 及 API/headless 角色。"
+
+msgid "**P0 and P1 wrappers**"
+msgstr "**P0 和 P1 包装脚本**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following `run_p0.sh` on P0. P0 hosts the Prefill API endpoint."
+msgstr "将以下 `run_p0.sh` 保存到 P0。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点。"
+
+msgid "Save the following `run_p1.sh` on P1. P1 is the headless Prefill rank."
+msgstr "将以下 `run_p1.sh` 保存到 P1。P1 是以 headless 模式运行的 Prefill rank。"
+
+msgid "Start the two Prefill ranks with the shared launcher:"
+msgstr "使用共享启动器启动两个 Prefill rank："
+
+msgid "**Common Decode template**"
+msgstr "**通用 Decode 模板**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the following `run_d.sh` on D0 and D1. Decode uses\n"
+"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode for the target model and keeps FlashComm1\n"
+"    disabled. The node wrappers below provide `LOCAL_IP`."
+msgstr ""
+"将以下 `run_d.sh` 保存到 D0 和 D1。Decode 为目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式，并保持 "
+"FlashComm1 禁用。下方的节点包装脚本提供 `LOCAL_IP`。"
+
+msgid "**D0 and D1 wrappers**"
+msgstr "**D0 和 D1 包装脚本**"
+
+msgid "Save the following `run_d0.sh` on D0:"
+msgstr "将以下 `run_d0.sh` 保存到 D0："
+
+msgid "Save the following `run_d1.sh` on D1:"
+msgstr "将以下 `run_d1.sh` 保存到 D1："
+
+msgid ""
+"Start four DP8/TP2 engines on each Decode node. `--dp-rank-start` is\n"
+"    `0` on D0 and `4` on D1. `--dp-address` is D0's IP on both nodes, and\n"
+"    the launcher assigns API ports `9900-9903` on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Decode 节点上启动 4 个 DP8/TP2 引擎。D0 的 `--dp-rank-start` 为 `0`，D1 为 `4`。两个节点的 "
+"`--dp-address` 均为 D0 的 IP 地址，启动器为每个节点分配 API 端口 `9900-9903`。"
+
+msgid "**Startup order**"
+msgstr "**启动顺序**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the services in this order: the first node of each group, the\n"
+"    remaining nodes, then the proxy."
+msgstr "按以下顺序启动服务：各组的第一个节点、其余节点、代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. Complete the container and multi-node communication checks on all\n"
+"       four nodes.\n"
+"    2. Start P0 with the launcher command above (`--dp-rank-start 0`). P0\n"
+"       hosts the Prefill API endpoint and the Prefill DP master.\n"
+"    3. Start D0 with its launcher command (`--dp-rank-start 0`). D0 hosts\n"
+"       the Decode DP master and four API endpoints.\n"
+"    4. Immediately after launching P0 and D0, start P1 and D1 with their\n"
+"       commands (`--dp-rank-start 1` and `--dp-rank-start 4`). Each DP group\n"
+"       completes initialization after all its ranks have started.\n"
+"    5. After all ten engines are ready, verify the API endpoints on P0, D0,\n"
+"       and D1 with `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models` and check the\n"
+"       headless P1 initialization logs. Start the proxy, then send requests\n"
+"       to `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081`."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 完成全部四个节点的容器及多节点通信检查。\n"
+"    2. 使用上方的启动器命令启动 P0（`--dp-rank-start 0`）。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点，并作为 Prefill DP 主节点。\n"
+"    3. 使用对应的启动器命令启动 D0（`--dp-rank-start 0`）。D0 作为 Decode DP 主节点，并提供 4 个 API 端点。\n"
+"    4. 启动 P0 和 D0 后，立即使用各自的命令启动 P1 和 D1（`--dp-rank-start 1` 和 `--dp-rank-start 4`）。每个 DP 组在其全部 rank 启动后完成初始化。\n"
+"    5. 全部 10 个引擎就绪后，使用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models` 验证 P0、D0 和 D1 上的 API 端点，并检查 headless 节点 P1 的初始化日志。启动代理，然后向 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送请求。"
+
+msgid "**Deploy the PD proxy**"
+msgstr "**部署 PD 代理**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Open another terminal in one Prefill container and start the\n"
+"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
+"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, sends Prefill requests to the P0 API\n"
+"    endpoint, and forwards Decode work to the eight Decode endpoints."
+msgstr ""
+"在任一 Prefill 容器中打开另一个终端，启动[负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。代理监听端口"
+" `8081`，将 Prefill 请求发送至 P0 API 端点，并将 Decode 工作转发至 8 个 Decode 端点。"
+
+msgid "**Key parameter differences from the Atlas 800I A3 layout**"
+msgstr "**与 Atlas 800I A3 布局相比的关键参数差异**"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Atlas 800I A2 uses the same global DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode sizes as\n"
+"      Atlas 800I A3, but spreads each role across two nodes with eight devices per\n"
+"      node. Each Atlas 800I A3 role runs on one node with 16 logical devices.\n"
+"    - P0 and P1 use the shared launcher with one local DP rank each. P0\n"
+"      exposes the Prefill API with `--api-server-count 1`; P1 is headless.\n"
+"      D0 and D1 each run four API-serving DP8/TP2 engines through their\n"
+"      node-specific wrapper scripts.\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` enables `use_ascend_direct` for direct\n"
+"      NPU-to-NPU KV transfer and declares the actual Prefill and Decode\n"
+"      `{dp_size, tp_size}` topology. The declared values must match the\n"
+"      real deployment.\n"
+"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 64` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`\n"
+"      with `--enforce-eager`; Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
+"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` with `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
+"      Both roles run with `--async-scheduling`.\n"
+"    - Both roles rely on model runner V1 via\n"
+"      `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`, consistent with the other tabs in\n"
+"      this guide. `VLLM_HOST_IP` advertises the IP that peers use to\n"
+"      reach each engine for KV transfer.\n"
+"    - MTP speculative decoding uses three speculative tokens on Atlas 800I A2.\n"
+"      `enforce_eager: true` keeps the MTP draft model in eager mode.\n"
+"    - `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` and `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` on\n"
+"      Decode reserve a disjoint 100-port window per DP rank (starting at\n"
+"      `60000 + rank * 100`). When several engines share one node, these\n"
+"      ranges prevent the HCCL host-side sockets from silently sharing\n"
+"      ports across ranks, which can block engine startup.\n"
+"    - The remaining timeout and runtime variables\n"
+"      (`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`, `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`,\n"
+"      `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`, `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`, `OMP_PROC_BIND`,\n"
+"      `OMP_NUM_THREADS`) are the validated Atlas 800I A2 startup defaults for this\n"
+"      model size; keep them unless your environment requires different\n"
+"      values.\n"
+"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must select the\n"
+"      service network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC,\n"
+"      engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must be allowed by the host\n"
+"      firewall."
+msgstr ""
+"- Atlas 800I A2 使用与 Atlas 800I A3 相同的全局 Prefill DP2/TP8 和 Decode DP8/TP2 配置，但每个角色分布在两个各有 8 个设备的节点上。Atlas 800I A3 的每个角色运行在一个具有 16 个逻辑设备的节点上。\n"
+"    - P0 和 P1 使用共享启动器，每个节点运行 1 个本地 DP rank。P0 通过 `--api-server-count 1` 提供 Prefill API；P1 以 headless 模式运行。D0 和 D1 通过各自的节点包装脚本，各运行 4 个提供 API 服务的 DP8/TP2 引擎。\n"
+"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 启用 `use_ascend_direct`，直接在 NPU 之间传输 KV，并声明实际的 Prefill 和 Decode `{dp_size, tp_size}` 拓扑。声明的值必须与实际部署一致。\n"
+"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 64`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 和 `--enforce-eager`；Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` 和 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。两个角色均使用 `--async-scheduling`。\n"
+"    - 两个角色均通过 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 使用 model runner V1，与本指南其他标签页一致。`VLLM_HOST_IP` 指定其他引擎在 KV 传输时用于访问本引擎的 IP 地址。\n"
+"    - Atlas 800I A2 上的 MTP 推测解码使用 3 个推测 Token。`enforce_eager: true` 使 MTP 草稿模型使用 eager 模式。\n"
+"    - Decode 上的 `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` 和 `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` 为每个 DP rank 预留互不重叠的 100 个端口（起始端口为 `60000 + rank * 100`）。当多个引擎共用一个节点时，这些端口范围可避免 HCCL 主机侧 socket 在不同 rank 之间意外共用端口，导致引擎启动阻塞。\n"
+"    - 其余超时和运行时变量（`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`、`HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`、`HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`、`VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`、`OMP_PROC_BIND`、`OMP_NUM_THREADS`）是针对该模型规模验证过的 Atlas 800I A2 启动默认值。除非环境要求其他值，否则请保持这些设置。\n"
+"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 和所有 socket 接口变量必须选择所配置节点 IP 使用的服务网络。主机防火墙必须允许 DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口。"
+
+msgid "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
+msgstr ""
+"### 5.4 使用 KV Cache 池的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署 {: #54-prefill-decode-"
+"disaggregation-with-kv-cache-pool }"
+
+msgid ""
+"This section uses the Memcache backend for Atlas 800I A3 and the Mooncake\n"
+"backend for Atlas 800I A2. Select the platform subsection that matches the PD\n"
+"topology in [Section 5.3](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment). Both\n"
+"platforms use `MultiConnector` to combine two connectors:"
+msgstr ""
+"本节在 Atlas 800I A3 上使用 Memcache 后端，在 Atlas 800I A2 上使用 Mooncake 后端。请选择与[第 5.3"
+" 节](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)中的 PD 拓扑对应的平台说明。两个平台均使用 "
+"`MultiConnector` 组合以下两个连接器："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` continues to transfer KV cache from Prefill to Decode.\n"
+"- `AscendStoreConnector` lets Prefill look up, load, and save cached prefixes\n"
+"  in the KV Cache Pool, reducing repeated Prefill computation."
+msgstr ""
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` 继续将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输至 Decode。\n"
+"- `AscendStoreConnector` 支持 Prefill 在 KV Cache 池中查询、加载和保存缓存前缀，减少重复的 Prefill 计算。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For backend installation, hardware dependencies, memory sizing, eviction,\n"
+"and tenant options, refer to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"有关后端安装、硬件依赖、内存大小、缓存淘汰和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache "
+"池部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse the Atlas 800I A3 DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode topology, launcher, and\n"
+"    proxy endpoint mapping from Section 5.3."
+msgstr "复用第 5.3 节中的 Atlas 800I A3 Prefill DP2/TP8 和 Decode DP8/TP2 拓扑、启动器及代理端点映射。"
+
+msgid "**Prepare the Memcache Backend**"
+msgstr "**准备 Memcache 后端**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Follow [Scenario 2: Memcache Backend](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
+"    for prerequisite checks and memory sizing. The Atlas 800I A3 HCCS\n"
+"    configuration uses `device_sdma`, which requires LingQu Computing Network\n"
+"    1.5 or later. Also check the HDK and CANN requirements in the guide's\n"
+"    [HDK and CANN Version Compatibility Reference](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-compatibility-reference).\n"
+"    **When starting the Atlas 800I A3 containers on both Prefill and Decode nodes, you must include the following read-only mount in the Docker command from Section 4.1:**"
+msgstr "请按照[场景 2：Memcache 后端](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)完成前置检查和内存大小配置。Atlas 800I A3 HCCS 配置使用 `device_sdma`，需要灵衢计算网络 1.5 或更高版本。还需检查指南中[HDK 和 CANN 版本兼容性参考](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-compatibility-reference)列出的 HDK 和 CANN 要求。**在 Prefill 和 Decode 两个节点上启动 Atlas 800I A3 容器时，必须在第 4.1 节的 Docker 启动命令中配置以下只读挂载：**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The Docker images in Section 4.1 already include `memfabric-hybrid` and\n"
+"    `memcache-hybrid`. Locate the installed Memcache package in each container:"
+msgstr ""
+"第 4.1 节的 Docker 镜像已经包含 `memfabric-hybrid` 和 `memcache-hybrid`。在每个容器中定位已安装的 "
+"Memcache 包："
+
+msgid ""
+"The `Location` field from `pip show` is `<PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES>` in the\n"
+"    commands below. Replace `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory\n"
+"    containing the configuration files on each node."
+msgstr ""
+"`pip show` 输出中的 `Location` 字段对应以下命令中的 `<PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES>`。请将 "
+"`<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为各节点上存放配置文件的绝对路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This example stores pooled KV cache in DDR memory on both the Prefill\n"
+"    and Decode nodes. The Memcache LocalService initializes within each vLLM\n"
+"    worker, and each worker contributes `20GB` of DDR memory to the pool.\n"
+"    Decode receives KV cache through `MooncakeConnectorV2`."
+msgstr ""
+"本示例在 Prefill 和 Decode 两个节点的 DDR 内存中存储池化 KV cache。Memcache LocalService 在各个 "
+"vLLM worker 内部初始化，每个 worker 向池中贡献 `20GB` DDR 内存。Decode 通过 "
+"`MooncakeConnectorV2` 接收 KV cache。"
+
+msgid "On the Prefill node, create `mmc-meta.conf`:"
+msgstr "在 Prefill 节点上创建 `mmc-meta.conf`："
+
+msgid ""
+"On both the Prefill and Decode nodes, create the following `mmc-local.conf`:"
+msgstr "在 Prefill 和 Decode 两个节点上创建以下 `mmc-local.conf`："
+
+msgid ""
+"`dram.size` specifies the DDR capacity allocated per worker. Prefill\n"
+"    (DP2/TP8) and Decode (DP8/TP2) each start 16 workers. At `20GB` per worker,\n"
+"    each node contributes `320GB`, for a total DDR pool capacity of `640GB`.\n"
+"    Reserve sufficient DDR memory for the operating system and vLLM. For\n"
+"    `device_sdma`, keep each non-zero size aligned to `1GB`."
+msgstr ""
+"`dram.size` 指定为每个 worker 分配的 DDR 容量。Prefill（DP2/TP8）和 Decode（DP8/TP2）各启动 16 "
+"个 worker。每个 worker 分配 `20GB` 时，每个节点贡献 `320GB`，DDR 池总容量为 `640GB`。请为操作系统和 vLLM"
+" 预留足够的 DDR 内存。使用 `device_sdma` 时，每个非零容量值均需按 `1GB` 对齐。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported by Memcache;\n"
+"    keep it consistent across all workers and large enough for the 32 workers\n"
+"    in this deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"`world_size` 是 Memcache 支持的最大 LocalService 数量。所有 worker 的配置必须一致，且足以容纳本部署中的 "
+"32 个 worker。"
+
+msgid "**Add the Pool Environment Variables**"
+msgstr "**添加池化环境变量**"
+
+msgid ""
+"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the Section 5.3 environment variables\n"
+"    and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`:"
+msgstr ""
+"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留第 5.3 节的环境变量，并在 `exec vllm serve` 前添加以下导出语句："
+
+msgid ""
+"Use the same `PYTHONHASHSEED` and Memcache service endpoints on both nodes.\n"
+"    Keep the HCCS communication settings from Section 5.3, including\n"
+"    `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` and `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES`."
+msgstr ""
+"两个节点须使用相同的 `PYTHONHASHSEED` 和 Memcache 服务端点。请保留第 5.3 节的 HCCS 通信设置，包括 "
+"`ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 和 `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES`。"
+
+msgid "**Update the Prefill and Decode Connectors**"
+msgstr "**更新 Prefill 和 Decode 连接器**"
+
+msgid ""
+"For Atlas 800I A3 KV Cache Pool deployment, add `--enable-prefix-caching` to both\n"
+"    `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh` in Section 5.3, and keep\n"
+"    chunked prefill enabled (the model default). GLM-5.3-Flash has\n"
+"    linear-attention state, and `AscendStoreConnector`\n"
+"    requires `mamba_cache_mode=align`; the model configuration selects this mode\n"
+"    when prefix caching is enabled. Keep the hybrid KV cache manager enabled\n"
+"    and `use_layerwise` disabled for this configuration."
+msgstr "部署 Atlas 800I A3 KV Cache 池时，请在第 5.3 节的 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中添加 `--enable-prefix-caching`，并保持分块预填充启用（模型默认行为）。GLM-5.3-Flash 包含线性注意力状态，`AscendStoreConnector` 要求 `mamba_cache_mode=align`；启用前缀缓存后，模型配置会选择此模式。此配置需要保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用，并禁用 `use_layerwise`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
+"    following fragment. Apart from the prefix-caching change above, keep\n"
+"    the remaining Atlas 800I A3 Prefill flags from Section 5.3, including\n"
+"    `--max-num-seqs 64`."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `run_p.sh` 最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。除上述前缀缓存调整外，请保留第 5.3 节中的其他 "
+"Atlas 800I A3 Prefill 参数，包括 `--max-num-seqs 64`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
+"    following fragment. Apart from the prefix-caching change above, keep\n"
+"    the remaining Atlas 800I A3 Decode flags from Section 5.3, including\n"
+"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `run_d.sh` 最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。除上述前缀缓存调整外，请保留第 5.3 节中的其他 "
+"Atlas 800I A3 Decode 参数，包括 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式和 MTP 配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"`$4` is the DP rank passed by `launch_online_dp.py`. Each engine must have a\n"
+"    unique `engine_id` and `lookup_rpc_port`; the child connectors inherit the\n"
+"    outer `engine_id`. The Prefill lookup values are `37000-37001`, and the\n"
+"    Decode lookup values are `37100-37107`. Keep the role-specific Mooncake KV\n"
+"    base ports from Section 5.3; its workers and schedulers derive their own\n"
+"    ports from the topology."
+msgstr ""
+"`$4` 是 `launch_online_dp.py` 传入的 DP rank。每个引擎必须具有唯一的 `engine_id` 和 "
+"`lookup_rpc_port`；子连接器继承外层的 `engine_id`。Prefill 的查询端口为 `37000-37001`，Decode "
+"为 `37100-37107`。请保留第 5.3 节中各角色的 Mooncake KV 基础端口，其 worker 和调度器会根据拓扑计算各自的端口。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Keep `memcache_dp_init_barrier` set to `true` on every rank in each DP\n"
+"    group. It synchronizes workers after Memcache initialization and before\n"
+"    NPU graph capture. Set it in the `AscendStoreConnector` child, as shown\n"
+"    above."
+msgstr ""
+"每个 DP 组的所有 rank 均须将 `memcache_dp_init_barrier` 设置为 `true`。它在 Memcache "
+"初始化后、NPU 图捕获前同步 worker。请如上所示，将该参数设置在 `AscendStoreConnector` 子连接器中。"
+
+msgid "**Start the Services**"
+msgstr "**启动服务**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the services in this order: Memcache MetaService, Decode, Prefill,\n"
+"    then the proxy. Each vLLM worker initializes its Memcache LocalService\n"
+"    during startup."
+msgstr ""
+"按以下顺序启动服务：Memcache MetaService、Decode、Prefill、代理。每个 vLLM worker 会在启动期间初始化自己的"
+" Memcache LocalService。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. In a separate terminal in the Prefill container, start MetaService.\n"
+"       Ensure ports `5000` and `6000` are reachable from both nodes and port\n"
+"       `8000` is available for metrics."
+msgstr ""
+"1. 在 Prefill 容器中的独立终端启动 MetaService。确保两个节点均可访问端口 `5000` 和 `6000`，且指标端口 "
+"`8000` 可用。"
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Start Decode with the Atlas 800I A3 launcher command in Section 5.3. Wait until\n"
+"       all eight Decode engines on ports `9900-9907` are ready and their\n"
+"       Memcache LocalServices have reserved the configured DDR pool memory.\n"
+"    3. Start Prefill with the Atlas 800I A3 launcher command in Section 5.3. Wait until\n"
+"       both Prefill engines on ports `9081-9082` are ready and their Memcache\n"
+"       LocalServices have reserved the configured DDR pool memory.\n"
+"    4. Start the Atlas 800I A3 proxy from Section 5.3. Send inference requests to\n"
+"       `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` using the examples in Section 6."
+msgstr ""
+"2. 使用第 5.3 节中的 Atlas 800I A3 启动器命令启动 Decode，等待端口 `9900-9907` 上的全部 8 个 Decode 引擎就绪，且其 Memcache LocalService 已预留配置的 DDR 池内存。\n"
+"    3. 使用第 5.3 节中的 Atlas 800I A3 启动器命令启动 Prefill，等待端口 `9081-9082` 上的两个 Prefill 引擎就绪，且其 Memcache LocalService 已预留配置的 DDR 池内存。\n"
+"    4. 启动第 5.3 节中的 Atlas 800I A3 代理，使用第 6 节的示例向 `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"
+
+msgid "**Verify KV Cache Reuse**"
+msgstr "**验证 KV Cache 复用**"
+
+msgid ""
+"Warm up the pool through the proxy with a prompt longer than one cache\n"
+"    block, then repeat requests with the same prefix. Check Prefill output for\n"
+"    successful pool saves, lookups, loads, and cache hits, and check Decode\n"
+"    output for successful P→D transfers."
+msgstr ""
+"通过代理发送长度超过一个缓存块的提示词以预热缓存池，然后重复发送具有相同前缀的请求。检查 Prefill "
+"输出，确认缓存池保存、查询、加载和缓存命中成功；检查 Decode 输出，确认 P→D 传输成功。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The proxy distributes requests across two Prefill engines. A repeated\n"
+"    request can also hit an engine's local prefix cache; confirm pool load/hit\n"
+"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse. Only\n"
+"    complete, cacheable blocks are reused, so a partial trailing block can\n"
+"    still require computation."
+msgstr ""
+"代理在两个 Prefill 引擎之间分发请求。重复请求也可能命中某个引擎的本地前缀缓存，因此需要在另一个 Prefill rank "
+"上确认缓存池加载或命中信息，以验证共享池复用。只有完整且可缓存的块会被复用，末尾不完整的块仍可能需要计算。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Reuse the `launch_online_dp.py` launcher, the P0/P1 and D0/D1 scripts, the\n"
+"    DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode topology, and the proxy configuration from\n"
+"    Section 5.3. Atlas 800I A2 nodes do not have the Atlas 800I A3 HCCS fabric: the\n"
+"    pool runs over the Atlas 800I A2 RoCE network with the `P2PHANDSHAKE` metadata server\n"
+"    and the `ascend` protocol, and the Atlas 800I A3 fabric-memory exports do not apply."
+msgstr ""
+"复用第 5.3 节中的 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器、P0/P1 和 D0/D1 脚本、Prefill DP2/TP8 和 "
+"Decode DP8/TP2 拓扑，以及代理配置。Atlas 800I A2 节点不具备 Atlas 800I A3 HCCS 网络，缓存池通过 Atlas 800I A2 RoCE 网络运行，使用 "
+"`P2PHANDSHAKE` 元数据服务器和 `ascend` 协议，不适用 Atlas 800I A3 的 fabric 内存环境变量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For backend installation, memory sizing, eviction, and tenant options, refer\n"
+"    to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"有关后端安装、内存大小、缓存淘汰和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache "
+"池部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"
+
+msgid "**Prepare the Mooncake Configuration**"
+msgstr "**准备 Mooncake 配置**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The Atlas 800I A2 Docker command in Section 4.1 already mounts `/etc/hccn.conf`.\n"
+"    Install the Mooncake backend according to the KV Cache Pool Deployment\n"
+"    Guide, then create the following `mooncake.json` on both Prefill nodes.\n"
+"    Mooncake Master runs in the first Prefill container at\n"
+"    `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:50088`."
+msgstr ""
+"第 4.1 节中的 Atlas 800I A2 Docker 命令已挂载 `/etc/hccn.conf`。请按照 KV Cache 池部署指南安装 Mooncake "
+"后端，然后在两个 Prefill 节点上创建以下 `mooncake.json`。Mooncake Master 运行在第一个 Prefill "
+"容器中，地址为 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:50088`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"On both Decode nodes, use the same JSON configuration with\n"
+"    `global_segment_size` set to `0`. Use the same `tenant_id` on all four\n"
+"    nodes. `global_segment_size` is registered per worker: with DP2/TP8\n"
+"    spread across two Prefill nodes, each node starts 8 workers. The validated\n"
+"    example uses `8GB` per worker, a `128GB` pool in total; adjust the\n"
+"    per-worker size to the available host memory, keeping each non-zero segment\n"
+"    size aligned to `1GB`. Keep `global_segment_size` at `0` in the Decode\n"
+"    `mooncake.json`."
+msgstr ""
+"两个 Decode 节点使用相同的 JSON 配置，但将 `global_segment_size` 设置为 `0`。全部四个节点须使用相同的 "
+"`tenant_id`。`global_segment_size` 按 worker 注册：DP2/TP8 分布在两个 Prefill "
+"节点上，每个节点启动 8 个 worker。验证过的示例为每个 worker 分配 `8GB`，池总容量为 `128GB`。请根据可用主机内存调整每个 "
+"worker 的容量，并保持每个非零段大小按 `1GB` 对齐。Decode 的 `mooncake.json` 中应保持 "
+"`global_segment_size` 为 `0`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the Section 5.3 environment\n"
+"    variables and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`. Replace\n"
+"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory containing that node's\n"
+"    `mooncake.json`."
+msgstr ""
+"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留第 5.3 节的环境变量，并在 `exec vllm serve` 前添加以下导出语句。请将"
+" `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为该节点上存放 `mooncake.json` 的绝对路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"All nodes must use the same `PYTHONHASHSEED`. Do not add the Atlas 800I A3\n"
+"    `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` export; it applies to the Atlas 800I A3 HCCS fabric\n"
+"    only. The general Atlas 800I A2 branch of the KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide also\n"
+"    suggests huge pages and `HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`; with the `P2PHANDSHAKE`\n"
+"    metadata server and the `ascend` protocol these are not required, and the\n"
+"    validated configuration does not set them."
+msgstr ""
+"所有节点必须使用相同的 `PYTHONHASHSEED`。不要添加 Atlas 800I A3 的 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM` "
+"导出语句，它仅适用于 Atlas 800I A3 HCCS 网络。KV Cache 池部署指南的通用 Atlas 800I A2 配置还建议使用大页和 "
+"`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE`；使用 `P2PHANDSHAKE` 元数据服务器和 `ascend` "
+"协议时不需要这些设置，验证过的配置也未设置它们。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Keep prefix caching and chunked prefill enabled. `use_layerwise` must\n"
+"    remain `false` for this model: the GLM-5.3-Flash hybrid KV cache contains a\n"
+"    non-prefix-cacheable group, and layer-wise pool transfer requires every\n"
+"    group to be cacheable, so the pool stores and loads whole segments. No\n"
+"    manual `--mamba-cache-mode` flag is needed either: when the connector list\n"
+"    contains `AscendStoreConnector`, the engine switches the mamba cache mode to\n"
+"    `align` automatically."
+msgstr ""
+"保持前缀缓存和分块预填充启用。此模型的 `use_layerwise` 必须保持为 `false`：GLM-5.3-Flash 的混合 KV cache"
+" 包含不可进行前缀缓存的组，而逐层缓存池传输要求所有组均可缓存，因此缓存池按整段存储和加载。也无需手动设置 `--mamba-cache-mode` "
+"参数：连接器列表包含 `AscendStoreConnector` 时，引擎会自动将 mamba 缓存模式切换为 `align`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
+"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Prefill flags from Section 5.3,\n"
+"    including `--max-num-seqs 64`."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `run_p.sh` 最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。请保留第 5.3 节中的其他 Prefill "
+"参数，包括 `--max-num-seqs 64`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
+"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Decode flags from Section 5.3,\n"
+"    including `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `run_d.sh` 最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为以下片段。请保留第 5.3 节中的其他 Decode "
+"参数，包括 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式和 MTP 配置。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Both role templates use the launcher DP-rank argument `$4` for the\n"
+"    `engine_id` suffix and lookup port. Each engine must have a unique\n"
+"    `engine_id` and `lookup_rpc_port`; the child connectors inherit the outer\n"
+"    `engine_id`. The Prefill lookup ports are `37000-37001`, and the Decode lookup\n"
+"    ports are `37100-37107`. The `prefill` and `decode` topology declared in the\n"
+"    `MooncakeConnectorV2` fragment must match the real deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"两个角色模板均使用启动器传入的 DP rank 参数 `$4` 生成 `engine_id` 后缀和查询端口。每个引擎必须具有唯一的 "
+"`engine_id` 和 `lookup_rpc_port`；子连接器继承外层的 `engine_id`。Prefill 的查询端口为 "
+"`37000-37001`，Decode 为 `37100-37107`。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 片段中声明的 `prefill` "
+"和 `decode` 拓扑必须与实际部署一致。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the services in this order: Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill →\n"
+"    Proxy."
+msgstr "按以下顺序启动服务：Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → 代理。"
+
+msgid ""
+"1. In a separate terminal in the first Prefill container, start Mooncake\n"
+"       Master. Ensure port `50088` is reachable from all four nodes."
+msgstr "1. 在第一个 Prefill 容器中的独立终端启动 Mooncake Master，确保全部四个节点均可访问端口 `50088`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"2. Start D0 and D1 with the launcher commands from Section 5.3\n"
+"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `4`; four engines per node on ports\n"
+"       `9900-9903`). Wait until all eight Decode engines answer\n"
+"       `curl /v1/models`.\n"
+"    3. Start P0 and P1 with the launcher commands from Section 5.3\n"
+"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `1`; P0 serves the API endpoint on port\n"
+"       `9081`, while P1 is headless). Wait until the P0 API endpoint is\n"
+"       ready and P1 logs confirm successful initialization.\n"
+"    4. Start the Atlas 800I A2 proxy from Section 5.3. Send inference requests to\n"
+"       `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` using the examples in Section 6."
+msgstr ""
+"2. 使用第 5.3 节中的启动器命令启动 D0 和 D1（`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `4`；每个节点在端口 `9900-9903` 上运行 4 个引擎），等待全部 8 个 Decode 引擎均可响应 `curl /v1/models`。\n"
+"    3. 使用第 5.3 节中的启动器命令启动 P0 和 P1（`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `1`；P0 在端口 `9081` 上提供 API 端点，P1 以 headless 模式运行），等待 P0 的 API 端点就绪，且 P1 日志确认初始化成功。\n"
+"    4. 启动第 5.3 节中的 Atlas 800I A2 代理，使用第 6 节的示例向 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Follow the KV Cache reuse verification steps in the Atlas 800I A3 subsection. The proxy\n"
+"    sends requests to the P0 API while the DP group uses both Prefill ranks. A\n"
+"    repeated request can hit a local prefix cache, so confirm pool load/hit\n"
+"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse."
+msgstr ""
+"按照 Atlas 800I A3 小节中的步骤验证 KV Cache 复用。代理向 P0 API 发送请求，而 DP 组使用两个 Prefill "
